  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Friday 27 November 2026 at 12:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nPerfect for first home buyers, investors, or down sizers. This 1960s cosy brick and tile corner unit offers entry level and a strong mix of location, low maintenance living, and top school zoning in St Heliers.\r\n\r\n• Layout & Size: 2 Bedrooms, 1 Bathroom, 1 Garage (with additional storage space), 105 m² floor area.\r\n• Title: Cross-lease (1/4 share of 1,447 m²).\r\n• Body Corporate: No Body Corp fees.\r\n• Extensively renovated with a new kitchen, updated bathroom, fresh paint, polished native timber floors, open-plan living, and a sun-soaked private yard.\r\n• Possession: Available for immediate possession.\r\n• School Zones: St Thomas School: Decile 10, Years 1–8 (340 m away). Selwyn College: Years 9–13 (520m away). Baradene College.\r\n\r\nMinutes from Eastridge Shopping Centre, St Heliers/Kohimarama beaches, local cafes, public transport, and key commuter routes to the Auckland CBD.\r\n\r\nYour next chapter starts here-don't miss this incredible opportunity!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
